<header><p class="enc-kicker">Person</p><h1 class="enc-title">Li Shiji</h1><p class="enc-meta"><span class="dates">594–669</span> · <a href="/centuries/7th-century">7th century</a> · Also known as Xu Shiji</p></header>
<div class="enc-body"><p class="enc-desc">Li <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/records-of-the-grand-historian">Shiji</a>, often called Li Ji, was one of the leading generals of the early <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/tang-dynasty">Tang dynasty</a> in <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/china">China</a>. He took part in the destruction of the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/eastern-turkic-khaganate">Eastern Turkic Khaganate</a> in 630 and served the emperors Taizong and Gaozong for decades. In 668, in alliance with Silla, his armies took <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/pyongyang">Pyongyang</a> and captured King Bojang, ending the kingdom of Goguryeo.</p><figure class="enc-fig"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/li-shiji.jpg" alt="Li Shiji" width="320" height="443" fetchpriority="high"><figcaption>Image: Unknown author · Public domain · <a href="https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:%E6%9D%8E%E5%8B%A3.png" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Wikimedia Commons</a></figcaption></figure></div>
<section class="enc-quotes"><h2 class="enc-section-title">Across the Institute</h2><ul><li><blockquote>In 668 the Tang general <b>Li Ji</b>, with Silla forces, took Pyongyang and captured King Bojang.</blockquote><a href="/empire/goguryeo">Goguryeo · Decline &amp; Fall</a></li></ul></section>
<section class="enc-where enc-born"><h2 class="enc-section-title">Born and died</h2><p class="enc-born-p">Born in Dongming County, in what is now <a href="/countries/china">China</a>. Died in <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/xian">Xi'an</a>, in what is now <a href="/countries/china">China</a>. <span class="enc-born-src">Places as Wikidata records them.</span></p><figure class="st-locator enc-loc"><a href="/atlas?at=35.23,115.01&amp;year=642" aria-label="Dongming County on the atlas"><svg class="map map-loc" viewBox="7461 890 900 540" role="img" aria-label="Map: the birthplace of Li Shiji"><image href="/maps/world.svg" x="0" y="0" width="10000" height="4393"/><path class="map-dot-halo" d="M7911 1160h0"/><path class="map-dot-me" d="M7911 1160h0"/></svg></a><figcaption>The dot marks the birthplace. <a href="/atlas?at=35.23,115.01&amp;year=642">What was here in 642 CE? &rarr;</a></figcaption></figure></section>
